        "title": "Brazil’s Radio Show That Sent Software as Sound",
        "description": "In 1980s Brazil, Clip Informática broadcast computer software as sound. With the right equipment, a cassette could capture the signal for a compatible computer to read.\n\nYears later, a developer tried to decode an old recording from the show. Explore the full story in the linked video below the channel name: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0RaC4t7yn5o\n\nThe audio signal is recreated for illustration.\n\n#RetroComputing #TechHistory #CassetteTape",
